{"format":1,"product":"exileds-gateway","channel":"stable","version":"0.1.3","platform":"windows-x86_64","git_commit":"d5f7518d8cd77c7b78ff9d5444257df11bdbeb21","protocol_version":55,"data_hash_format":9,"base_data_hash":"be54a1933f3a8c890650e7855ba79a4af326bb58797fedaa4ab65b53b267f41d","min_launcher_version":"0.0.0","notes":"# eXiled's Gateway 0.1.3\n\n- The whole game can be finished: Mephisto, Izual, Nihlathak and Baal now spawn; the Hell Gate opens to Act 4 when\n  Mephisto dies; Diablo opens a red portal to Harrogath; the Inner Cloister leads into the Cathedral again.\n- Barbarian: Whirlwind spins and costs mana once per spin; shouts play their cast and ring; Leap and Leap Attack arc\n  and land; Find Item, Find Potion and Grim Ward work once per corpse.\n- Every class's skills checked at level 99; Strafe fires with a short quiver; new curses and armors replace old ones.\n- Items: inventory charms give their stats (one of each unique charm), class block bonus, superior and low quality\n  rules, gambled and low quality items are never ethereal, sold items can be bought back until the vendor restocks.\n- Warps: you arrive in front of the stairs or cave mouth, and walking into the stairs takes them.\n- HD: river water shows in its bed, no diamond seams around buildings, chests sit on the ground, the cave mouth at\n  the Den of Evil stays visible, and level changes show a loading backdrop instead of a long black screen.\n- New D2R style screens: the map overlay, the Online realm pages (with Paste buttons), the title video above the menu,\n  and the UI fixes from the last play-test.\n- Online play predicts your movement, and item, shop and stash commands are never lost.\n- Mod authors get every dev and editor tool in a release build once they unlock their author key; the Dev Panel is\n  hidden from everyone else.\n","files":[{"path":"OFL.txt","size":4476,"sha256":"7f697b85bfc1926ca58321fde712c31dab831a47376ba2650148348b21e56a4e","url":"https://github.com/Devz952/exi